    "body": "In the chromium implementation we do have different strings added for the other cases mentioned in https://github.com/fergald/explainer-bfcache-ccns/blob/main/README.md#sensitive-information. The reason list was mistakenly not synchronized with the spec.\r\n\r\nAnyway, I think we would start a separate discussion to keep the list up-to-date, but probably that should not block this changes from being merged? We open this because we are adding these particular reason strings and we want to at least make them aligned with the spec.",
